KISS Psycho Circus: The Nightmare Child recomp

Started from the Shogo: Mobile Armor Division recomp
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/shogo-recomp), whose module loader is derived
from the Unreal Tournament recomp (https://github.com/sp00nznet/ut99-recomp)
and whose layout is the Crazy Taxi recomp's. It runs on pcrecomp's native32
runtime (https://github.com/sp00nznet/pcrecomp). All MIT.

